<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>Compliance with any city or county ordinance which provides for disclosure of information relating to solicitations or sales solicitations for charitable purposes substantially similar to and no less than the disclosure requirements of this article shall be deemed to satisfy the requirements of this article. The provisions of this article are not intended to preempt any city or county ordinance.</p></caml:Content>